<title>ITALY: Olivetti plans board meeting Wed - sources.</title>
<headline>Olivetti plans board meeting Wed - sources.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olivetti is expected to hold a board meeting on Wednesday afternoon with an unspecified agenda, industrial sources said.</p>
<p>The Paris-based International Herald Tribune reported on Wednesday that the Olivetti board would meet to discuss a management shakeup which could result in the ousting of chief executive Francesco Caio.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for Olivetti said she was unable to comment on the report.</p>
<p>--Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
